(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#" :text "Modal provider driver: parses a preset .asn (the one place every version is pinned), renders the Modal-side app.py (outside the tracked tree) and what it reads, the modal command lines and the gateway provider entry, builds the aslGateway/plugin record (capabilities, OpenAI-compatible row, lifecycle whose spending ops the contract gates), and speaks the endpoint's /v1/chat/completions contract")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#lowerAlphabet" :text "--- character classes ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#imageRef?" :text "a pin names one release: a registry reference with an explicit tag that is not latest")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#atomText" :text "--- ASN property lists ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#parseTier" :text "--- GPU ladder and pool ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#parseTier" :text "a tier may override the weight file: PTQ1_0 decodes faster on Ada and smaller parts, PQ2_0 on Ampere (model card)")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#pinsField" :text "every package is pinned to one release (name==version), so a rebuild installs the same bytes")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#tierFilesAre?" :text "--- preset ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalAppName" :text "--- rendering ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalAppEnv" :text "app.py reads the same preset file, so its environment names only the file and the tier")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalAppSettings" :text "the settings app.py derives from the preset and tier, keys sorted; app.py --settings prints the same JSON, and the test compares the two")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalCli" :text "uvx runs the Modal client release the preset pins, whatever modal is installed")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalDeployArgv" :text "deploy spends money: the CLI only renders this argv, and the lifecycle runs it only after the budget gate allows the deploy")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalPrepareArgv" :text "prepare starts a CPU container that downloads weights into the volume; rendered, never run here")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalGatewayEntry" :text "a batch beyond what the containers run at once only queues inside Modal, so peakCount is capped by maxConcurrency x maxContainers")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalCapabilities" :text "--- plugin (aslGateway/plugin contract) ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalCapabilities" :text "rates are USD per GPU-second for every ladder tier, so a router can price a tier change; the preset keeps micro-USD integers")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalCapabilities" :text "a Modal web endpoint answers a request still running after 150 s with a 303 to its result; the gateway follows it")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalStartCost" :text "the least a start can cost: one cold start plus the idle window before scale-down, at the tier's GPU price, in micro-USD, the unit budget.asl adopts")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalLifecycleRequest" :text "the request the gateway hands pluginDeploy!/pluginStart! for this endpoint: unit is the work unit the budget charges, the tier rides in gpu")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalLifecycleArgv" :text "start wakes the scale-to-zero container with one health probe; Modal bills from then until the scale-down window ends")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#requestError" :text "a request for another endpoint, tier, model or pinned version is refused before any process starts")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalStatusFrom" :text "maps `modal app list --json` rows (keys app_id description state tasks, modal 1.6.1 cli/app.py) to the contract's states; a deployed app with no running task is cold")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#lifecycleOp!" :text "the contract's pluginDeploy!/pluginStart! run the budget gate before these fns, so nothing here gates again; deploy renders app.py first")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalRow" :text "one OpenAI-compatible row: the URL is the tier's web endpoint, the key comes from the env var the preset names, never from a file")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalChatBody" :text "--- endpoint contract ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalChatWith!" :text "the key is passed in by the caller, travels only in the curl config on stdin, and is never logged")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalConfig" :text "--- runbook: gateway config and smoke ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalConfig" :text "everything ~/.asl/gateway.asn needs for one tier, as one ASN form the operator merges by hand; the cap and its approval carry the same microUSD value, which is what budget.gate requires for a paid deploy")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalSmokeWorstCost" :text "the most a smoke can bill: the startup bound for the cold start, two chats at their timeout, then the idle window")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalSmokeGate" :text "smoke starts a GPU container: it runs only with --yes and a --cap that covers its worst case")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#smokeChat!" :text "smoke reads usage only: a reasoning model may spend a small max_tokens on thought, which is a measurement here, not a failure")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalSmokeWith!" :text "cold start is status cold to the first 200 from /health; first token is a max_tokens 1 chat; tok/s is a 256-token chat; cost bills the GPU from the first probe to the end of the idle window")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalAppLines" :text "--- the Modal-side app: rendered from here, never tracked as a .py file ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalAppLines" :text "the principal-accepted Modal SDK edge lives as ASL data; modalRenderApp! writes it outside the tracked tree, and it reads the same preset file at deploy time")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#modalAppDir!" :text "the rendered app lives outside the tracked tree, one directory per preset app and tier, so no Python is ever tracked")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#usage" :text "--- CLI: renders, never runs modal ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/src/modal.asl#render!" :text "app, deploy and prepare render app.py under ~/.asl/run/modal first; printing a command never runs it")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/tests/modalTest.asl#" :text "MODALAPP: preset parse and typed validation errors, exact env, command and gateway rendering, app.py derives the same settings from the same preset, the plugin capability record, lifecycle ops behind the budget spend gate with an injected runner, and the /v1/chat/completions contract against an ASL stub; nothing here runs modal")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/tests/modalTest.asl#testShippedPreset!" :text "--- preset parse ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/tests/modalTest.asl#testEnvAndCommands!" :text "--- rendering ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/tests/modalTest.asl#runQuiet!" :text "--- app.py compiles ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/tests/modalTest.asl#testAppRenders!" :text "app.py is never tracked: the test renders it from modal.asl into a temp dir and checks the render")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/tests/modalTest.asl#writeAll" :text "--- endpoint contract against an ASL stub ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/tests/modalTest.asl#stubAnswer" :text "the stub enforces the contract a Modal-served engine answers: POST /v1/chat/completions, bearer key, served model name, max_tokens")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/tests/modalTest.asl#pythonSettings!" :text "--- one preset, two readers ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/tests/modalTest.asl#near?" :text "--- plugin (aslGateway/plugin contract) ---")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-modal/tests/modalTest.asl#testConfig!" :text "--- runbook: config and smoke ---")
